<p><table cellpadding=2 cellspacing=2 border=0 width="100%">
<tr bgcolor=#CD853F>
<td><font size=4><b><i>TEST: Kill Spiders In WC</i></b></font></td><td><b>Date:&nbsp;</b>3/10/2001</td><td><b>Start:&nbsp;</b>5:00 CST</td></tr>
<tr bgcolor=#CD853F>
<td><b>Location:&nbsp;</b>West Commonlands</td><td><b>Level Min:&nbsp;</b>10</td><td><b>End:&nbsp;</b>9:00 CST</td></tr>
<tr bgcolor=#F5DEB3><td colspan=3><b>Description:</b>&nbsp;We will hunt down and kill all spiders in the West Commonlands. What the hey, eh?<br><br>
This is where you would describe the raid, and then list who will be showing up. Attending: Frick, Frack, Frock, Doofus, Goofus, Boofus.<br><br>
OR (if you know some HTML...)
<ul>
<li>Frick</li>
<li>Frack</li>
<li>Frock</li>
<li>Doofus</li>
<li>Goofus</li>
<li>Boofus</li>
</ul></td></tr>
<tr bgcolor=#F5DEB3><td colspan=3><b>Results:</b>&nbsp;This will be where the results of the raid are posted.</td></tr>
<tr bgcolor=#F5DEB3><td colspan=3><b>Organized by:</b>&nbsp;Gwil Starblade&nbsp;<a href="mailto:toddvw@hotmail.com?subject=Raid: TEST: Kill Spiders In WC" title = "Send e-mail to organizer about raid"><IMG src="images/mailto.gif" border=0 WIDTH=14 HEIGHT=11></a></td></tr>
