<p><table cellpadding=2 cellspacing=2 border=0 width="100%">
<tr bgcolor=#CD853F>
<td><font size=4><b><i>Saturday in the City of Mist</i></b></font></td><td><b>Date:&nbsp;</b>3/24/2001</td><td><b>Start:&nbsp;</b>3pm Central</td></tr>
<tr bgcolor=#CD853F>
<td><b>Location:&nbsp;</b>City of Mist</td><td><b>Level Min:&nbsp;</b>35</td><td><b>End:&nbsp;</b>sometime</td></tr>
<tr bgcolor=#F5DEB3><td colspan=3><b>Description:</b>&nbsp;Personally haven't been here, but looks like a good spot for the 40s crowd...       </P> A note on the loot rules:  all roll for everything except   1) you've won that same item once already    2) it's no drop class specific.  </P> I'll explain my thoughts in a seperate post, but that's the way my raids will be ;)</td></tr>
<tr bgcolor=#F5DEB3><td colspan=3><b>Results:</b>&nbsp;Not a bad raid...   although it was a bad night for that zone, up to 60 people at times which was way too many.  Fal and Az won wraithbone hammers, I won a Green Jaded Broadsword, that's about all that dropped in 9 hours... but we had at least 2 dings, and most everyone had a good time.  Thanks to all that came.

Cuh</td></tr>
<tr bgcolor=#F5DEB3><td colspan=3><b>Organized by:</b>&nbsp;Cuhulain Lughson&nbsp;<a href="mailto:mrrsy@home.com?subject=Raid: Saturday in the City of Mist" title = "Send e-mail to organizer about raid"><IMG src="images/mailto.gif" border=0 WIDTH=14 HEIGHT=11></a></td></tr>
</table>
</form></p>

<form action="aw_raid_edit.asp" method="post">
<input type=hidden name=organizerid id=organizerid value=9>
<input type=hidden name=raidid id=raidid value=3>
<p><table cellpadding=2 cellspacing=2 border=0 width="100%">
<tr bgcolor=#CD853F>
<td><font size=4><b><i>The Warrens -------  20ish Twink night!</i></b></font></td><td><b>Date:&nbsp;</b>4/11/2001</td><td><b>Start:&nbsp;</b>7pm central</td></tr>
<tr bgcolor=#CD853F>
<td><b>Location:&nbsp;</b>The Warrens</td><td><b>Level Min:&nbsp;</b>16</td><td><b>End:&nbsp;</b>11pm central</td></tr>
<tr bgcolor=#F5DEB3><td colspan=3><b>Description:</b>&nbsp;Dunno how a Wed. night is for everyone, but it was the earliest I could plan on, a general consensus will move it to Thursday.  The place is Really train bound, one or two snare/root people will be required.  I'll say 16 to 22 for the level range, hopefully that will keep everyone in the xp if we can fight big enough critters.</td></tr>
<tr bgcolor=#F5DEB3><td colspan=3><b>Results:</b>&nbsp;This was a lot of fun, I was really glad to be able to group with some of our lower level members as well as twinks of the higher folks.  We had a few wipe-outs in the King room, but all in all it was fun.  Next time we'll have to be sure to bring along a chanter ;)</td></tr>
<tr bgcolor=#F5DEB3><td colspan=3><b>Organized by:</b>&nbsp;Cuhulain Lughson&nbsp;<a href="mailto:mrrsy@home.com?subject=Raid: The Warrens -------  20ish Twink night!" title = "Send e-mail to organizer about raid"><IMG src="images/mailto.gif" border=0 WIDTH=14 HEIGHT=11></a></td></tr>
</table>
</form></p>

<form action="aw_raid_edit.asp" method="post">
<input type=hidden name=organizerid id=organizerid value=9>
<input type=hidden name=raidid id=raidid value=4>
<p><table cellpadding=2 cellspacing=2 border=0 width="100%">
<tr bgcolor=#CD853F>
<td><font size=4><b><i>Velk's Labrynth</i></b></font></td><td><b>Date:&nbsp;</b>4/7/2001</td><td><b>Start:&nbsp;</b>4pm Central</td></tr>
<tr bgcolor=#CD853F>
<td><b>Location:&nbsp;</b>Velketor's Labrynth</td><td><b>Level Min:&nbsp;</b>40</td><td><b>End:&nbsp;</b>whenever</td></tr>
<tr bgcolor=#F5DEB3><td colspan=3><b>Description:</b>&nbsp;Ok, we should do something this weekend, so here it is!  Level is 40+  but if we have someone just a bit below this that wants to come, you're welcome to, just not sure how the xp will be with possibly much higher people there.</td></tr>
<tr bgcolor=#F5DEB3><td colspan=3><b>Results:</b>&nbsp;Not a bad little raid, we picked up a few extra people to fill out the groups and most everyone had a good time, hehe, at least I hope so ;)  I would have liked to stay just a bit longer, but the place started filling up with other people so we decided to call it a night.  Nice place for xp, only two spawns were green to me at 47.  Terrible place to pull in, the puller has to keep see invis up at all times and the slick spots make for some interesting pulls...  The biggest fall I took only around 300hp damage, not too bad but it's still extra damage.  Anyhow, it's a nice place for xp, but you really have to have crowd control, there are many pulls that only come in 2s and 3s.  THanks to everyone that made it.</td></tr>
<tr bgcolor=#F5DEB3><td colspan=3><b>Organized by:</b>&nbsp;Cuhulain Lughson&nbsp;<a href="mailto:mrrsy@home.com?subject=Raid: Velk's Labrynth" title = "Send e-mail to organizer about raid"><IMG src="images/mailto.gif" border=0 WIDTH=14 HEIGHT=11></a></td></tr>
</table>
</form></p>

